--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

XState

Portions of this software are derived from XState
(https://github.com/statelyai/xstate), version 5.33.2: the ported
state-machine semantics (the statechart algorithm, the actor runtime, the
actions, guards and actor logic, the graph traversal, and the upstream error
and warning messages), and the test suite (the upstream test files rewritten
under packages/core/test/upstream/, the SCXML converter that supports them,
ported from upstream src/scxml.ts, and the data taken from the upstream tests:
the frozen test inventory and the graph snapshots). XState is distributed
under the following license:

The MIT License (MIT)

